  - [1mC. Three views + "Week starting" date.[0m The same radio group as A, but you pick any start day and the table shows
    that day and the six after it.

  I recommend [1mA[0m. It maps one-to-one onto the three things you said people want. It uses only components the guidelines
  already define: a RadioGroup, which allows a horizontal layout for three short labels, and a Select, which is meant
  for six or more options. It has no invalid states, so there are no validation messages. The trade-off: you can only
  pick calendar weeks. If someone wants Wednesday through Tuesday, they'd look at two weeks.

  Click one in the browser if you like, but please answer here in the terminal.

